en we run out of menu items. I also have to chart the costs of the food. Another problem is making sure we have the right number of staff members to serve the clientele.", "time": "15000", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le07ob02re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I wouldn't want people to come to work on a slow night. You could have some employees on backup.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sometimes we can, but people need to know when they are going to work. Then there's the problem of ambiance.  We want the restaurant to be busy, but not too noisy. When people go out, they want to be able to socialize. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  It all sounds so exciting!", "time": "39500", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le07ob02re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le07ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le07ob02re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "id": 0}]}